</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m/s</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的速率運動，求它的德布羅意波長。</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">答案以 nm 表示，四捨五入至三位有效數字。</p><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0%;\"><div class=\"Container-PpxXyQ\" data-w-component=\"\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-size=\"lg\" data-focused=\"false\" data-pill=\"\"><input data-d-component=\"input\" placeholder=\"輸入數值，例如 0.123\" id=\"_r_dp_\" class=\"Input-S5bfLR\" data-lpignore=\"true\" data-1p-ignore=\"true\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"></div></div>",
